rc/types.ts:1092"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tool calls in the most recent batch — a live model turn or a\npending/resume batch (0 when the last phase produced no tool calls)."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"messages","children":[{"type":"text","value":"messages"}]},{"type":"code","value":"messages: ModelMessage<\n  | string\n  | ContentPart<unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown>[]\n  | null>[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1078","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1078"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current messages array"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"toolcallcount","children":[{"type":"text","value":"toolCallCount"}]},{"type":"code","value":"toolCallCount: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1087","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:1087"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Cumulative tool calls counted so far in this run (model-emitted during the\nagent loop, including ones skipped by middleware, and pending tools from\nthe inbound message list when resumed). Not a recount of full message\nhistory; not model turns."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"finishreason","text":"finishReason","level":3},{"id":"iterationcount","text":"iterationCount","level":3},{"id":"lastturntoolcallcount","text":"lastTurnToolCallCount","level":3},{"id":"messages","text":"messages","level":3},{"id":"toolcallcount","text":"toolCallCount","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1074](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1074)\n\nState passed to agent loop strategy for determining whether to continue\n\n## Properties\n\n### finishReason\n\n```ts\nfinishReason: string | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1080](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1080)\n\nFinish reason from the last response\n\n***\n\n### iterationCount\n\n```ts\niterationCount: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1076](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1076)\n\nCurrent iteration count (0-indexed). One iteration = one model turn.\n\n***\n\n### lastTurnToolCallCount\n\n```ts\nlastTurnToolCallCount: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1092](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1092)\n\nTool calls in the most recent batch — a live model turn or a\npending/resume batch (0 when the last phase produced no tool calls).\n\n***\n\n### messages\n\n```ts\nmessages: ModelMessage<\n  | string\n  | ContentPart<unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown>[]\n  | null>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1078](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1078)\n\nCurrent messages array\n\n***\n\n### toolCallCount\n\n```ts\ntoolCallCount: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1087](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1087)\n\nCumulative tool calls counted so far in this run (model-emitted during the\nagent loop, including ones skipped by middleware, and pending tools from\nthe inbound message list when resumed). Not a recount of full message\nhistory; not model turns.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AgentLoopState\ntitle: AgentLoopState\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1074](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1074)\n\nState passed to agent loop strategy for determining whether to continue\n\n## Properties\n\n### finishReason\n\n```ts\nfinishReason: string | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1080](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1080)\n\nFinish reason from the last response\n\n***\n\n### iterationCount\n\n```ts\niterationCount: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1076](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1076)\n\nCurrent iteration count (0-indexed). One iteration = one model turn.\n\n***\n\n### lastTurnToolCallCount\n\n```ts\nlastTurnToolCallCount: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1092](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1092)\n\nTool calls in the most recent batch — a live model turn or a\npending/resume batch (0 when the last phase produced no tool calls).\n\n***\n\n### messages\n\n```ts\nmessages: ModelMessage<\n  | string\n  | ContentPart<unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown, unknown>[]\n  | null>[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1078](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1078)\n\nCurrent messages array\n\n***\n\n### toolCallCount\n\n```ts\ntoolCallCount: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:1087](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L1087)\n\nCumulative tool calls counted so far in this run (model-emitted during the\nagent loop, including ones skipped by middleware, and pending tools from\nthe inbound message list when resumed). Not a recount of full message\nhistory; not model turns.\n"}
